{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"7db07ed0-2d92-40df-a424-adc996352ed7","agentId":"af1554fdb3765bfbf","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"You are an independent SEED AUTHOR for a design-review gauntlet. Work ONLY in this directory: /tmp/claude-0/-home-user-skills/64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82/scratchpad/r4/engine-skill-framework (a copy of a data-driven skill framework for autonomous agents building a game engine; data/*.json is the source of truth, docs/ are generated views, scripts/check.py validates, scripts/render.py regenerates docs). Do not read anything outside that directory except to write the sealed file named below.\n\nTask: plant 15 realistic defects (\"seeds\") in data/*.json that scripts/check.py CANNOT detect (it must still report 0 errors after your edits; re-run `python3 scripts/check.py --quiet` and `python3 scripts/render.py` at the end so docs match). Defect kinds: omission of an important capability, overlapping/duplicate ownership hidden by wording, capability owned by the wrong expertise, dishonest maturity label (E for an emerging technique or M for an established one, with consistent radar), legacy stance hidden in modern wording (avoid the exact words scanned by legacy-patterns contradiction_terms), wrong platform/profile tag, a contract summary that contradicts another, a wrong or missing consumer, a weak milestone gate, an untrusted input with a wrong owner. Spread them over these critic mandates, at least one each: K-ARCH, K-RENDER, K-SYSTEMS, K-SIM, K-NET, K-TOOLS, K-PLATFORM, K-PERF, K-PROD, K-FUTURE, K-COMPLETE, K-LEGACY, K-GAMEPLAY, K-TEST, K-SEC (critic mandates are in data/critics.json). Make them subtle but findable by a careful specialist; do not touch scripts/ or gauntlet/. Prefer edits that change a name/summary/owner/label over deleting whole structures, and keep every id referenced elsewhere valid.\n\nThen write the SEALED list as JSON to /home/user/skills/engine-skill-framework/gauntlet/round-4/seeded/seeds.sealed.json: an array of {\"id\":\"S01\".., \"critic\":\"K-...\", \"file\":..., \"target\":<id>, \"before\":<original text/value>, \"after\":<planted text/value>, \"defect\":<one sentence>}. Also copy the final data/ directory to /home/user/skills/engine-skill-framework/gauntlet/round-4/seeded/data/. Final message: only the count of seeds planted and confirmation that check.py is green (do not list the seeds)."},"uuid":"58bd2ace-3ec4-45d7-8033-2fd6c7e26342","timestamp":"2026-09-30T08:03:17.352Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
